{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":281901,\"title\":\"Manhunt: The Search for the Yorkshire Ripper\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Occurring from the mid-1970s to 1981, the Ripper committed 13 murders. Viewed as ritualistic in nature, they were done with extreme brutality as he mocked the police during their desperate hunt for him. The victims were primiarly prostitutes or poor girls, with a few working girls tossed in. Generally he would hit a victim on the head with a hammer, sexually assault the lady, mutilate her, and then redress/re-arrangement the clothing and cover the corpse with her own coat.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fdeoPwiFbXXplxhHqKedG0zw35F.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":1999,\"runtime\":120,\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Crime\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"GB\",\"name\":\"United Kingdom\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":67026,\"name\":\"Janet Suzman\",\"character\":\"Narrator\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5H1cxIbRuIlpqOxU1rsGAetrsyi.jpg\"},{\"id\":3668405,\"name\":\"Andrew Laptew\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1580003,\"name\":\"Christa Ackroyd\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ekrTLujE1mq0VYeHJ6VlaUNKhLH.jpg\"},{\"id\":4598918,\"name\":\"Megan Winterburn\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5022594,\"name\":\"Dick Holland\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1699155,\"title\":\"Maternal Instinct\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dOWWCLSwXS1MBtGEFeItbloiUEN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oGD1dZvojZssnd9Ua6RUalEEHQu.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Police pull over a woman who claims she just gave birth. But the baby — and the blood — aren't hers. Twisted lies unravel in this true-crime documentary.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1662317,\"title\":\"The Crash\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/veskdPx4YUTmkrFrTs6zRJ8VV4E.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2iqLoDsatVBwAvHTEzI71p3qBe9.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A teen slams her car into a building, killing her boyfriend and his friend. What seems like a tragic accident becomes a murder case.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":44639,\"title\":\"Inside Job\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7yXXIWec24htucjsZS1sDuPLqw8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1yFmxvVYgVrFKL2ksFzgX0MrWOM.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A film that exposes the shocking truth behind the economic crisis of 2008. The global financial meltdown, at a cost of over $20 trillion, resulted in millions of people losing their homes and jobs. Through extensive research and interviews with major financial insiders, politicians and journalists, Inside Job traces the rise of a rogue industry and unveils the corrosive relationships which have corrupted politics, regulation and academia.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1400782,\"title\":\"The Perfect Neighbor\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2NE7yN45zo19o4LJr6JFxDWmh2b.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2a3CC6VpCjqZ23Fe18GstMGg5Pj.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Police bodycam footage reveals how a long-running neighborhood dispute turned fatal in this documentary about fear, prejudice and Stand Your Ground laws.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":489931,\"title\":\"American Animals\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aLbdKxgxuOPvs6CTlmzoOQ4Yg3j.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i28c1bKsnl1O0uqy6HeRWtioOXl.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2018,\"type